      InputName="Nanite Snow/Dust Depth Disable with Camera Intersection"
      Description="True by default. If true, snow depth from nanite displacement will be disabled when the camera gets close enough to intersect the snow. This can help correct for the camera going below the landscape mesh due to the snow not having collision."
