      InputName="Puddle Color and Opacity"
      Description="Determines the color and how opaque the puddles are. The alpha channel is a multiplier for the puddle mask, not in a 0 to 1 range. The default alpha of 5 produces a slightly foggy liquid. Higher values will be more opaque and lower values will be more transparent."
